WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your back with the legs extended and hands tucked under the hips, palms down.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Press the forearms and elbows firmly into the floor.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Inhale and lift the chest, arching the upper back off the mat.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Let the crown of the head rest lightly on the floor, weight in the elbows — not the neck.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Breathe into the open chest, then release the head and lower down.
